{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_05_title", "source_sha256": "91ae9fd4ca2ef11fcdf0d4e4664cad7eb64aeb1d935db1533bd46888321557f0", "ja": "あなたならわかること", "zh": "若是你就会明白的事", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "6cc14c242e8343c73b8d06c14a6acc157fdd03f6f36114de9605161f6af2d0b0", "ja": "駆けつけたプロデューサーを排除しようと\nする劇場の魂。だがアイドル達の、「仲間\nだからこそ本気で競い合える」「プロデュー\nサーがいるから心配いらない」という言葉に\n説得され、今回は退散するのだった。", "zh": "剧场之魂试图排除赶来支援的制作人。然而，在偶像们以“正因为是伙伴，才能认真地相互竞争”和“有制作人在就不用担心”的话语劝说下，这次只好退去了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_05_1000_p", "source_sha256": "11a2e9cdb50e52960b068faea8225710c2a6cb16c9f097a2d35a1c6e17a134c1", "ja": "（この数日、何となく違和感があったんだけど……\nすべては、劇場の魂のしわざだった！）", "zh": "（这一切都是剧场之魂干的！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_05_1001_012mam", "source_sha256": "96cfb3750520f9cf22439e7925feb12ac469c86c6996be6a65bb15ccaa62bc02", "ja": "「封鎖してある劇場に入ってくるなんて……！\n{$P$}、どうやってここに！？」", "zh": "「竟然闯进了已经封锁的剧场……！\n{$P$}，你到底是怎么进来的！？」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_05_1002_p", "source_sha256": "8a5943a60fa17123cd561f0e40c72ad7ba12693f74045842ef918e7dd2f15265", "ja": "鍵を持っているからな！　それに、ここには\n前にも来たことがあるから、何となく。", "zh": "因为我带着钥匙啊！而且之前也来过这里，所以就凭感觉找到了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_05_1003_012mam", "source_sha256": "7152cbdc6b3eec0fa31d7d3931febae81f9aa6e4238be99784973c2459a80d2b", "ja": "「そういえばそうだった」", "zh": "“说起来还真是这样”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_05_1004_039kon", "source_sha256": "6d951d9bef8bea11366dbe796a111a3379f61123b2b870af1cf34782eb0ca05e", "ja": "{$P$}。\n劇場の魂のこと、知ってるの？", "zh": "{$P$}先生。\n您知道剧场之魂的事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_05_1005_p", "source_sha256": "ff56f46d2dd6dfee71941c040c09ead19c3984b6d4afdd489fd7fdeeb4ee0887", "ja": "ええ、何度か遭遇した事が……。\n劇場の魂、どうしてこんなことを？", "zh": "是的，我也遇到过几次……\n剧场之魂，为什么要做这种事？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_05_1006_012mam", "source_sha256": "8ad0120adc9d8e388ba959896519b8f9028b8b9900812286b78781f341bfd77f", "ja": "「私だって、みんなのこと、\n静かに見守るつもりだった。でも……」", "zh": "“我也本来打算，\n安安静静守护大家的。可是……”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_05_1007_012mam", "source_sha256": "a6bd3a6a5e18c81b909cf7248726c519584749debfb88ba06d6232573074277e", "ja": "「やっぱり無理！　チーム対抗だけならまだしも\n……同じグループで対決なんて、あり得ない！」", "zh": "「果然还是不行！如果只是队伍对抗也就算了……同一个组合还要对决，根本不可能啦！」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_05_1008_p", "source_sha256": "9b5f50ae157b4f233ef7f6ed788edaaf85071aa874c5895cb374e00133e0045a", "ja": "ぐっ！？　プレッシャーが……！", "zh": "呃！？这压力……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_05_1009_012mam", "source_sha256": "02576c7e41cfb0efb58db5ea76405a92d21a36f0ad88d10c48644c29e2c98e53", "ja": "「劇場はアイドル達の夢が叶う場所。こうなったら\nアナタを排除して、もう一度最初から……！」", "zh": "“剧场是让偶像们的梦想成真的地方。事到如今\n只能将你排除掉，再次从头开始……！”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_05_1010_018ele", "source_sha256": "2bc2b70acf79541f25801c8c892848ec56e3990e50134b9d25d9a0af4f42d466", "ja": "ま、待ってゲキコ！　{$P$}が\nいなくなったら、ワタシたちすっごく困るヨ！", "zh": "等、等等，剧场！要是{$P$}不在了，我们会非常困扰的哟！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_05_1011_012mam", "source_sha256": "ee0cbaea55b63eb52eac9f2ef521fbb4360745e88862738d5091788c7c480c77", "ja": "「困る？　どうして？　みんなだって、\n本当はバトルなんてしたくないでしょ？」", "zh": "“困扰？为什么？大家心里，\n其实也根本不想战斗对吧？”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_05_1012_012mam", "source_sha256": "5e4dfb6ab04a56c1b0d6c2de0915b13264464329570dc7a9af11285812f7bd26", "ja": "「今までどおり、ずーっと仲良しがいいよね？」", "zh": "「像以前那样，一直都要好下去不是挺好的吗？」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_05_1013_010azu", "source_sha256": "ce8fa2c8fc4fb9d932b1a362d3429c6382142e14308e8fac3d8b44baea12374b", "ja": "そうね……私も、戦うことが\n好きなわけではないけど……。", "zh": "是啊……我也不是喜欢战斗，只是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_05_1014_010azu", "source_sha256": "ad073c652a0c173343e903e87d1e9fd628e72c4502b0424bf4965e6432c61e95", "ja": "でも、本気で頑張ってるみんなは、大好き。\n……みんな、そうなんじゃないかしら。", "zh": "不过，我最喜欢认真努力的大家了。\n……大家不都是这样吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_05_1015_018ele", "source_sha256": "9d8d73fdf803211c25431681859e6c106c770a68d1eceddb32c91e69ba5066fd", "ja": "アズサ……！", "zh": "阿梓莎……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_05_1016_041fuk", "source_sha256": "1c6d280003b1ddf8b988d37550fd4a757a731fae089d5deb83574e425c667416", "ja": "わかります。私も、戦うとか競争とか、\n得意なほうじゃないけど……。", "zh": "我明白。虽然战斗、竞争之类的事情，\n我也不是很擅长就是了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_05_1017_041fuk", "source_sha256": "d519795003119d08d9ddd3e5fa033b691e8073cf2df4a92c1d04590bddfe8ece", "ja": "でも、仲間だからこそ……\n負けたくないって気持ちがあるのも、本当なの。", "zh": "可是，正因为是伙伴……才会有不想输的心情，这也是真心话。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_05_1018_041fuk", "source_sha256": "c5208e1eab201ee36b214e2aff2afc8034b1e3b925dc8b307a102a0b27adbabf", "ja": "げき子ちゃんなら……私たちを、ずっと見ていて\nくれたあなたなら、わかるんじゃないかな……？", "zh": "剧子的话……一直看着我们的你，应该能明白吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_05_1019_012mam", "source_sha256": "3b0d050e4e989eed97a3ea46301a4e27b6187bc745218ac8c3c32b5b267dbc58", "ja": "「……っ！」", "zh": "「……！」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_05_1020_039kon", "source_sha256": "0b8716a02984b9140cec1963e54b5bc91650958d378ed06abee386b9f5a01229", "ja": "それに、私たちには\n{$P$}がいるもの！", "zh": "而且，我们还有{$P$}在嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_05_1021_039kon", "source_sha256": "498b82d79ebb0ec88766bee783a1a6d7dbae7ed97bb97d53d1014af12e5828ac", "ja": "私たちがこのバトルで迷った時は、\nしっかりフォローしてくれる。そうでしょ？", "zh": "当我们在这场对决中迷失方向时，\n你会好好地支持我们的。对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_05_1022_p", "source_sha256": "96126b504bc09c23357e22343ef7f00b9a2b808f68f0aea56964659d77b141f0", "ja": "もちろん！　俺達はみんなを傷つけたいわけじゃない。\n……なあ、劇場の魂。もういいんじゃないか？", "zh": "那是当然！我们并不是想伤害大家。\n……喂，剧场之魂。差不多可以了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_05_1023_p", "source_sha256": "a798b541622a98c3645254515fe71c08bed71e3f394d99e98375a08b1e173166", "ja": "そもそも、本人たちの感情を無視して、\n強引に仲良くさせるのはアリなのか？", "zh": "说到底，无视她们本人的感受，强行让她们和好，真的合适吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_05_1024_012mam", "source_sha256": "73502830f370fe87f3ae717e4e0957b1cceae9c7da706889de034322aa181d10", "ja": "「っ、うるさいっ！」", "zh": "“吵、吵死了！”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_05_1025_p", "source_sha256": "5cb31aefe5fb84c3be47dbefde5568e9f86ffd16a3232f8ba61bc1e2df83182d", "ja": "うぐっ！？　お、重……！", "zh": "呜呃！？好、好沉……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_05_1026_012mam", "source_sha256": "f3b1cd05fd39e45a458d9c166a56aa0ccc76728cc8a4b64c4f64633da6bdc970", "ja": "「……わかった。みんなの意見を尊重して、\nもう少しだけ我慢してあげる」", "zh": "“……知道了。就尊重大家的意见，\n真美再忍耐一会儿好了”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_05_1027_012mam", "source_sha256": "94c26cedea5abcb3de283265eb7f99028fd36cac102ac94829024220d2d802a7", "ja": "「{$P$}、勝ったと思わないで。\n私は、諦めないから……！」", "zh": "「{$P$}，你别以为自己赢了。\n我是绝对不会放弃的……！」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_05_1028_048rei", "source_sha256": "229877fbe54d10b0eb6e77a265b2d0c15c154f07d103a0e3b716fed34a65525b", "ja": "心配いらないよ、げき子ちゃん！\n私たち、こう見えてたくましいんだから。えっへん♪", "zh": "不用担心哦，小剧子！\n我们可不是看上去那么柔弱的。哼哼♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_05_1029_048rei", "source_sha256": "8fab7ab84d3bbd25bea9d29fb7f30bcaab42bea2085a773edcb8347cb951338f", "ja": "でも、心配してくれてありがとう。\nまたね？　バイバーイ！", "zh": "不过，谢谢你为我担心。\n下次见？拜拜！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_05_1030_012mam", "source_sha256": "2ecb78681db669cf7be063656781dd7c02ef749ce4cb9d1e3331f11eb0e83a7c", "ja": "「……うん。バイバイ」", "zh": "“……嗯。拜拜”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_05_1031_se", "source_sha256": "28c1961fdfbae7179de5a488381165b99080c49b9df4c5928b99d6acaec28f95", "ja": "パアアアアアア！", "zh": "唰啊啊啊啊啊啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0414_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0414_story_05_1032_p", "source_sha256": "f3df4aabc0cbe379aea72baebf66663d7e0584a5c99ccddde11c2fab7aef38e0", "ja": "（うっ、光が全てを包んでいく！\nこれで、みんな元の世界に………………っ！）", "zh": "（呜，光芒将一切包裹起来了！这样一来，大家就能回到原来的世界………………！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
